WEBVTT

00:01:42.360 --> 00:01:44.990
While the show was on a one year break,

00:01:44.990 --> 00:01:50.090
Gin-san, Kagura-chan, and everyone else I knew changed into completely different people.

00:01:50.090 --> 00:01:54.420
And they all claimed that two years had passed since the show went off the air.

00:01:53.830 --> 00:01:55.580
[Wartirine / Warti / Wartise]

00:01:54.420 --> 00:01:56.520
I tried to escape this cruel reality

00:01:56.520 --> 00:01:58.640
and arrived at the beach,

00:01:58.640 --> 00:02:01.070
only to find a very different Kyubei-san!

00:02:01.070 --> 00:02:03.880
And there was more to come...

00:02:03.880 --> 00:02:06.710
Enough, Sir Kyubei.

00:02:06.710 --> 00:02:07.800
You...

00:02:07.800 --> 00:02:09.390
I...

00:02:12.450 --> 00:02:16.420
...became Zurako!

00:02:16.480 --> 00:02:22.020
[Everyone Looks Pretty Grown Up After Summer Break]

00:02:22.190 --> 00:02:24.350
Your characters don't overlap at all!

00:02:24.350 --> 00:02:27.070
You stinkin' lunatic!

00:02:28.110 --> 00:02:31.820
You're the only one who's stupid enough to have his balls removed to avoid character overlap!

00:02:31.820 --> 00:02:35.270
And hell, you're both trannies now!

00:02:35.270 --> 00:02:36.880
C-Curses!

00:02:36.880 --> 00:02:40.370
I was so focused on the details that I lost sight of the big picture!

00:02:40.370 --> 00:02:42.830
That's not all you lost!

00:02:42.830 --> 00:02:44.020
Sir Kyubei!

00:02:44.020 --> 00:02:48.940
It appears that we are doomed to share the same character traits.

00:02:48.940 --> 00:02:53.050
One of us must be eliminated for the sake of more screen time.

00:02:53.050 --> 00:02:55.060
One has both balls and boobs.

00:02:55.060 --> 00:02:57.330
The other has neither balls nor boobs.

00:02:57.330 --> 00:03:01.240
Let us determine who the true transsexual is!

00:03:01.240 --> 00:03:03.810
The position of gay bar champion...

00:03:03.810 --> 00:03:06.340
...shall be mine!

00:03:06.340 --> 00:03:09.080
Is that even worth fighting over?!

00:03:10.100 --> 00:03:11.490
What the hell...

00:03:11.770 --> 00:03:15.480
First people growing, now people changing their gender...

00:03:15.480 --> 00:03:18.000
The only thing that hasn't changed...

00:03:18.000 --> 00:03:20.830
...is how they're still a bunch of idiots.

00:03:21.330 --> 00:03:23.000
There you are.

00:03:21.330 --> 00:03:28.090
[Shinsengumi]

00:03:23.000 --> 00:03:24.520
Stinkin' four eyes.

00:03:24.520 --> 00:03:28.480
You got guts to escape from your first day on the job, an?

00:03:28.580 --> 00:03:31.390
You're ready to die, an?

00:03:36.890 --> 00:03:38.110
O-Okita-san?!

00:03:38.110 --> 00:03:39.610
That bazooka is Okita-san's!

00:03:39.610 --> 00:03:41.600
What are you babblin' about?

00:03:41.600 --> 00:03:45.800
I don't see you for a while, and you need glasses for your brain now, an?

00:03:45.800 --> 00:03:47.360
It's me.

00:03:47.360 --> 00:03:49.770
Vice-Commander of the Shinsengumi.

00:03:49.770 --> 00:03:52.070
Jimmy Yamazaki, an?

00:03:52.990 --> 00:03:56.230
What?!

00:03:56.230 --> 00:03:57.800
Now move your ass, an?

00:03:57.800 --> 00:03:59.040
No way!

00:03:59.040 --> 00:04:00.750
Average Joe Yamazaki?!

00:04:00.750 --> 00:04:02.950
That's ancient history!

00:04:02.950 --> 00:04:06.400
Back when I was still a cherry boy!

00:04:06.400 --> 00:04:08.880
I stand fully erect now!

00:04:08.880 --> 00:04:13.170
I'm Jimmy Yamazaki, the vice-commander who makes crying babies cry harder, an?

00:04:14.130 --> 00:04:15.180
Whoa!

00:04:15.180 --> 00:04:16.950
What happened?!

00:04:16.950 --> 00:04:18.920
You're addicted to anpan now!

00:04:18.920 --> 00:04:21.030
It's even showing up in your speech!

00:04:21.030 --> 00:04:22.950
Hey, start driving, an?

00:04:22.950 --> 00:04:23.600
Uh...

00:04:23.600 --> 00:04:26.860
I said to drive the damn car, nitwit!

00:04:26.860 --> 00:04:28.030
Ow...

00:04:28.030 --> 00:04:31.990
Well, I wanted to say hello first since it's been a while.

00:04:31.990 --> 00:04:35.910
Nobody's gonna remember a no name like you, an?

00:04:35.910 --> 00:04:38.410
It's been so long, Shinpachi-kun.

00:04:38.410 --> 00:04:40.840
I'm Toshiro Hijikata.

00:04:40.840 --> 00:04:42.120
Do you remember me?

00:04:42.120 --> 00:04:43.330
Of course not.

00:04:43.330 --> 00:04:44.650
Hi-Hijikata-san?!

00:04:44.650 --> 00:04:45.810
Is this Hijikata-san?!

00:04:45.810 --> 00:04:46.630
No way!

00:04:46.630 --> 00:04:49.350
Hijikata-san would never smile like this!

00:04:49.350 --> 00:04:51.650
Especially not after being slapped around by someone like Yamazaki-san!

00:04:51.650 --> 00:04:55.510
Hey, what's that supposed to mean? Explain, Hijikata, an?

00:04:55.890 --> 00:04:59.110
He's smiling after being hit for no reason!

00:04:59.110 --> 00:05:01.350
A lot's happened.

00:05:01.350 --> 00:05:05.130
I took over as commander after Kondo-san retired,

00:05:05.130 --> 00:05:09.600
but it became painfully clear that ruling through fear would no longer work.

00:05:09.600 --> 00:05:15.120
And after some thinking, I decided to halve my way of life, my mayonnaise intake, and my calorie intake.

00:05:15.120 --> 00:05:19.700
As a result, I'm now known as Toshi-san, the Shinsengumi's collective bitch.

00:05:19.700 --> 00:05:22.350
You ended up losing your position in the process!

00:05:22.350 --> 00:05:25.260
Still, I never thought I'd have the opportunity to work with you.

00:05:25.260 --> 00:05:26.310
It's making me blush.

00:05:26.310 --> 00:05:28.370
Could you please stop being so creepy?

00:05:28.850 --> 00:05:31.030
How are Gin-san and Kagura-chan doing?

00:05:31.030 --> 00:05:32.520
They should have tagged along.

00:05:32.520 --> 00:05:35.510
It's been pretty lonely without Kondo-san around.

00:05:34.390 --> 00:05:35.930
Hijikata!

00:05:35.930 --> 00:05:37.180
Enough already!

00:05:37.180 --> 00:05:38.420
How can you call yourself Hijikata?!

00:05:38.420 --> 00:05:40.230
How?!

00:05:40.230 --> 00:05:41.510
I don't believe this...

00:05:41.510 --> 00:05:44.140
The Shinsengumi has seen a complete overhaul...

00:05:44.140 --> 00:05:45.230
Wait.

00:05:45.230 --> 00:05:46.240
That means...

00:05:45.770 --> 00:05:47.020
[Shinsengumi Station]

00:05:52.270 --> 00:05:54.760
The Shinsengumi Kaiser!

00:05:54.760 --> 00:06:00.290
Seig heil, Herr Okita de Sade Sogo III!

00:06:00.290 --> 00:06:02.020
Kaiser!

00:06:02.020 --> 00:06:03.710
Kaiser!

00:06:03.710 --> 00:06:05.860
Kaiser!

00:06:08.460 --> 00:06:12.570
He's been promoted way past the rank of commander...

00:06:13.080 --> 00:06:15.430
Silence, gentlemen.

00:06:15.430 --> 00:06:18.460
Two years have passed since the formation of the Holy Shinsengumi Empire.

00:06:18.460 --> 00:06:19.400
Empire?!

00:06:19.400 --> 00:06:20.600
This is an empire?!

00:06:20.600 --> 00:06:25.460
Thanks to your efforts, the empire has been able to extend its influence.

00:06:25.460 --> 00:06:28.780
We now control over half of Edo.

00:06:28.780 --> 00:06:31.220
You don't sound like the police anymore!

00:06:31.220 --> 00:06:36.100
It won't be long before the day comes when we slaughter the Shogun and hoist the flag of our empire...

00:06:36.100 --> 00:06:37.590
...over Edo Castle!

00:06:37.590 --> 00:06:39.180
That would make you Joi!

00:06:39.180 --> 00:06:41.890
That would make you terrorists now!

00:06:41.890 --> 00:06:46.350
However, we must first take control of a certain area before we can begin our crusade.

00:06:46.350 --> 00:06:48.790
An impregnable town of steel...

00:06:48.790 --> 00:06:51.830
A lawless place for the ruffians of Edo to gather...

00:06:52.460 --> 00:06:54.180
The Kabuki district!

00:06:53.840 --> 00:06:56.840
[Kabuki District 1st Street]

00:06:54.180 --> 00:06:56.840
If we don't secure this town before launching our attack on Edo Castle,

00:06:56.840 --> 00:06:58.760
it will come back to haunt us.

00:06:58.760 --> 00:07:00.070
But worry not!

00:07:00.070 --> 00:07:03.150
Every stronghold has a weakness!

00:07:03.150 --> 00:07:05.880
And I now have the means to exploit that weakness.

00:07:06.810 --> 00:07:10.040
We have taken a friend of Shogun Sakata, the fearless general of the Kabuki district...

00:07:10.040 --> 00:07:11.570
...as a hostage!

00:07:11.570 --> 00:07:15.020
The town of steel will fall quickly now.

00:07:15.020 --> 00:07:16.450
Hold on!

00:07:16.450 --> 00:07:17.470
Who is this fearless general?!

00:07:17.470 --> 00:07:19.720
Are you trying to crush Odd Jobs?!

00:07:19.720 --> 00:07:24.160
I will eliminate anyone who stands in the way of my ambition.

00:07:24.160 --> 00:07:25.190
Your ambition?!

00:07:25.190 --> 00:07:28.890
When did you join the camp of cliche Edo dominating megalomaniacs, Jerkaiser!

00:07:28.890 --> 00:07:30.930
Hey, that was uncalled for.

00:07:30.930 --> 00:07:32.990
At the very least, you should address me as Jerk of a Kaiser.

00:07:32.990 --> 00:07:34.750
I get annoyed when people combine words.

00:07:35.750 --> 00:07:40.630
Normally, I would have you executed, but I'll spare your life since you have use as a hostage.

00:07:40.630 --> 00:07:42.020
Hijikata, take him away.

00:07:42.020 --> 00:07:43.040
Yes, Jerkaiser!

00:07:43.040 --> 00:07:44.350
Yamazaki, smack him.

00:07:44.350 --> 00:07:45.830
Yes, Jerkaiser!

00:07:45.830 --> 00:07:47.570
Why is this catching on?

00:07:47.570 --> 00:07:49.170
Someone, execute everyone besides the hostage.

00:07:49.170 --> 00:07:51.350
Yes, Jerkaiser!

00:07:50.000 --> 00:07:51.350
Fine, have it your way.

00:07:51.350 --> 00:07:53.410
Starting tomorrow, I'll change my title to Jerkaiser.

00:07:53.410 --> 00:07:56.270
But make the "Jer" inaudible.

00:07:58.630 --> 00:07:59.750
Damn it...

00:07:59.750 --> 00:08:01.470
What's going on?

00:08:01.470 --> 00:08:03.320
Why is this happening?

00:08:03.320 --> 00:08:05.340
I'm sick of this world...

00:08:05.340 --> 00:08:08.750
Nobody I know is here...

00:08:09.760 --> 00:08:12.540
Stop sniffling, you wimp.

00:08:12.540 --> 00:08:15.080
I finally found someone normal,

00:08:15.080 --> 00:08:17.270
but you don't look like you'll be much help.

00:08:17.270 --> 00:08:18.730
Hi-Hijikata-san?

00:08:18.730 --> 00:08:20.230
Are you...

00:08:21.070 --> 00:08:22.510
Yeah...

00:08:22.510 --> 00:08:27.320
I was also left behind two years, just like you.

00:08:38.410 --> 00:08:40.900
Here is this week's spotlight.

00:08:40.900 --> 00:08:45.470
This week's spotlight came in third on the sales chart.

00:08:47.370 --> 00:08:51.010
The third single from singer-songwriter MADAO-san.

00:08:51.010 --> 00:08:53.410
The God of Cardboard!

00:08:53.410 --> 00:08:55.300
This is quite a surprise.

00:08:55.300 --> 00:08:56.790
Another top-seller?

00:08:56.040 --> 00:08:57.210
[Beer is Best]

00:08:56.790 --> 00:08:57.550
Did you cut your hair?

00:08:57.550 --> 00:08:59.930
Actually, I grew it out.

00:09:00.170 --> 00:09:03.660
MADAO-san got the inspiration for this song from the sound of

00:09:00.170 --> 00:09:11.060
[How MADAO got his break]

00:09:00.170 --> 00:09:11.060
[Reenactment]

00:09:03.670 --> 00:09:06.040
tearing apart cardboard when he was living on the streets.

00:09:06.690 --> 00:09:11.480
He performed many concerts on the street before achieving his current popularity.

00:09:11.480 --> 00:09:14.780
So how does it feel to go from living on the streets to cutting your hair?

00:09:14.780 --> 00:09:15.860
Uh, I didn't cut my hair.

00:09:15.860 --> 00:09:17.120
I grew it out.

00:09:17.120 --> 00:09:20.440
Ah, we're running out of time, so please get on stage.

00:09:20.440 --> 00:09:22.870
Here's MADAO-san with "I Cut My Hair."

00:09:22.870 --> 00:09:24.780
I said I didn't cut my hair!

00:09:24.780 --> 00:09:26.070
Do you want me to cut my hair?!

00:09:26.070 --> 00:09:27.640
Do I look bad with long hair?!

00:09:27.640 --> 00:09:29.350
What's going on?

00:09:29.350 --> 00:09:31.310
That's what I want to know.

00:09:31.310 --> 00:09:35.240
I went back to the station after the one year break, and everything was different.

00:09:35.240 --> 00:09:38.580
As though everyone else had spent the past two years without me...

00:09:38.580 --> 00:09:40.810
But why...

00:09:40.810 --> 00:09:43.020
Why did you pretend to be different?

00:09:43.470 --> 00:09:47.070
Because I thought that I was the one who was crazy.

00:09:47.070 --> 00:09:48.500
Wouldn't you?

00:09:48.500 --> 00:09:50.940
Every other person had changed.

00:09:50.940 --> 00:09:53.500
I was the exception.

00:09:53.500 --> 00:09:57.250
Given the situation, what else could I do but laugh?

00:09:56.100 --> 00:09:57.770
[Please wait one moment.]

00:09:57.230 --> 00:10:00.620
But I guess I couldn't handle it.

00:10:00.620 --> 00:10:03.190
D-Damn you, Hijikata!

00:10:03.190 --> 00:10:06.340
You think you're gonna get away with this, an?

00:10:09.160 --> 00:10:10.370
Hijikata-san...

00:10:10.370 --> 00:10:13.600
Did we travel through time?

00:10:13.870 --> 00:10:18.080
We're the only ones stuck in a completely different world.

00:10:18.440 --> 00:10:22.120
Why did this happen to us?

00:10:22.120 --> 00:10:25.090
Maybe we're being punished...

00:10:26.910 --> 00:10:28.410
Hijikata-san...

00:10:28.790 --> 00:10:31.000
To be honest, I've been...

00:10:31.000 --> 00:10:33.620
...slacking off on playing the straight man.

00:10:34.500 --> 00:10:38.870
I was always exhausted after dealing with the onslaught of funny men.

00:10:38.870 --> 00:10:41.130
Despite all the work, I wasn't very popular.

00:10:41.130 --> 00:10:42.690
And there wasn't much merchandise featuring me.

00:10:42.690 --> 00:10:46.880
I had to wonder if playing a funny man paid better dividends...

00:10:47.110 --> 00:10:50.400
So while they were airing reruns for the past year,

00:10:47.110 --> 00:10:50.410
[Yorinuki Gintama-san]

00:10:50.400 --> 00:10:54.080
I kicked back and completely forgot about playing the straight man.

00:10:50.410 --> 00:10:54.030
[Otsuu Plus]

00:10:54.540 --> 00:10:59.080
But while I was doing nothing,

00:10:59.070 --> 00:11:02.460
everyone else found something to do and build on.

00:11:02.460 --> 00:11:04.250
They were moving forward.

00:11:04.770 --> 00:11:07.510
That's why I was left behind...

00:11:09.290 --> 00:11:12.220
I'm guessing that you know what I'm talking about.

00:11:13.380 --> 00:11:15.690
You were the only normal person in the Shinsengumi.

00:11:15.690 --> 00:11:18.020
You were also in the straight man position.

00:11:18.730 --> 00:11:21.930
But then you added that funny man persona, Tosshi...

00:11:21.930 --> 00:11:23.350
That was because of the sword...

00:11:23.350 --> 00:11:25.220
...and engaged in bizarre behavior involving mayonnaise.

00:11:25.220 --> 00:11:27.200
I just happen to like mayonnaise!

00:11:27.200 --> 00:11:29.540
Then how do you explain the smiling act?

00:11:29.540 --> 00:11:32.630
You just wanted to play a funny man, didn't you?

00:11:32.630 --> 00:11:33.850
Enough.

00:11:33.850 --> 00:11:37.380
Can you honestly say that you weren't trying to enjoy yourself?

00:11:37.380 --> 00:11:40.350
I said enough already, damn it!

00:11:42.010 --> 00:11:43.420
I'm sorry.

00:11:43.420 --> 00:11:44.620
I shouldn't have said that.

00:11:44.620 --> 00:11:46.880
Nah, I shouldn't have snapped at you.

00:11:46.880 --> 00:11:47.990
Just forget it.

00:11:48.860 --> 00:11:51.320
If the world was twisted into its current state by an oversaturation of funny men

00:11:51.320 --> 00:11:55.230
because the two of us stopped playing straight men,

00:11:56.060 --> 00:12:00.140
we don't have any right to gripe about it.

00:12:01.490 --> 00:12:02.830
Yeah...

00:12:03.430 --> 00:12:08.620
We have to live in this world...

00:12:08.620 --> 00:12:10.060
...as punishment.

00:12:15.090 --> 00:12:16.520
I'm heading back...

00:12:16.520 --> 00:12:18.820
...to the Holy Shinsengumi Empire.

00:12:18.820 --> 00:12:20.910
I'll try to stop the kaiser...

00:12:20.910 --> 00:12:22.940
...from attacking Odd Jobs.

00:12:22.940 --> 00:12:24.830
That's not going to help anything.

00:12:25.240 --> 00:12:26.720
I see...

00:12:26.720 --> 00:12:30.540
I plan on working at Odd Jobs.

00:12:30.540 --> 00:12:32.560
Gin-san may look like Yamcha

00:12:32.560 --> 00:12:34.440
and Kagura may be bigger than me,

00:12:34.440 --> 00:12:36.580
but Odd Jobs is still the same place.

00:12:36.580 --> 00:12:38.690
Good luck playing the straight man.

00:12:38.690 --> 00:12:39.940
Same to you.

00:12:41.510 --> 00:12:45.600
Not that it's going to change anything...

00:12:48.240 --> 00:12:51.060
Now, we have a breaking news update.

00:12:51.060 --> 00:12:55.380
The mysterious wart outbreak is continuing to spread throughout Edo.

00:12:55.380 --> 00:12:59.260
Medical scientists have finally determined the source of this malady.

00:12:59.260 --> 00:13:02.960
The warts, which attach themselves to organisms and absorb their life energy

00:13:02.960 --> 00:13:06.060
before eventually taking over the host body,

00:13:06.060 --> 00:13:10.710
have been identified as parasitic aliens known as Q'Sai Nettles.

00:13:10.710 --> 00:13:13.440
First, the aliens transform into the figure on your left

00:13:13.440 --> 00:13:15.640
and assimilate information from the host.

00:13:15.640 --> 00:13:19.110
Eventually, it transforms into something completely identical to the host.

00:13:19.110 --> 00:13:20.460
The alien supplants the host

00:13:20.460 --> 00:13:25.150
and matures the appearance of the host by two years after a few days.

00:13:25.150 --> 00:13:30.230
It should be noted that these aliens are attracted to ambition.

00:13:30.230 --> 00:13:33.530
People with more ambition have a higher chance of being infected,

00:13:33.530 --> 00:13:36.590
and the aliens will evolve according to that ambition.

00:13:36.590 --> 00:13:41.690
Do you know anyone who's gone through a sudden change and talked about two years passing?

00:13:41.690 --> 00:13:44.700
It's possible that they've been infected by Q'Sai Nettles.

00:13:45.160 --> 00:13:48.560
First, you should check if the comatose original is hanging from the body.

00:13:48.560 --> 00:13:52.740
Then use something like a paper fan to smack the Q'Sai Nettle as hard as you can.

00:13:52.740 --> 00:13:55.800
Your friends have not changed!

00:13:55.800 --> 00:13:57.930
Two years haven't passed!

00:13:57.930 --> 00:14:01.510
The world before you is...

00:14:01.510 --> 00:14:04.610
...a world with warts!

00:14:05.060 --> 00:14:06.890
Oh? Kusano-san?

00:14:06.890 --> 00:14:08.680
There's something hanging from your head...

00:14:08.680 --> 00:14:09.440
Is that...

00:14:09.440 --> 00:14:10.060
Huh?

00:14:11.470 --> 00:14:13.180
So wait.

00:14:13.180 --> 00:14:13.820
What?

00:14:13.820 --> 00:14:16.290
In other words...

00:14:16.570 --> 00:14:19.370
They're all Wartiharu?!

00:14:19.370 --> 00:14:21.900
Yamcha Gin-san is just a Yamcha wart!

00:14:21.900 --> 00:14:24.580
The grown-up Kagura-chan is just a wart with two big warts!

00:14:24.580 --> 00:14:27.830
The gorilla couple is two warts making a wart baby!

00:14:27.830 --> 00:14:29.840
Ambition, huh?

00:14:29.840 --> 00:14:31.530
Ironic.

00:14:31.530 --> 00:14:35.730
We weren't infected because we were slacking off.

00:14:36.260 --> 00:14:40.500
And now, we're the only ones who can save them!

00:14:40.500 --> 00:14:44.440
I know exactly what I need to do now!

00:14:44.440 --> 00:14:47.500
We're gonna paper fan this twisted wartiworld!

00:14:47.500 --> 00:14:50.190
And take back our world!

00:14:51.860 --> 00:14:54.150
Shinpachi!

00:14:54.150 --> 00:14:56.580
Where did you go?

00:14:56.580 --> 00:14:58.540
I was looking everywhere for you!

00:14:58.540 --> 00:14:59.440
Ka-Kagura-san?!

00:14:59.440 --> 00:15:00.500
You dummy!

00:15:00.500 --> 00:15:02.070
I was so worried!

00:15:02.070 --> 00:15:02.720
Hey!

00:15:02.720 --> 00:15:04.310
Smack her with the fan!

00:15:04.310 --> 00:15:06.050
That's just the wart!

00:15:06.050 --> 00:15:08.120
Ka-Kagura-san!

00:15:08.120 --> 00:15:12.130
It's not fair to press that body up against me!

00:15:12.940 --> 00:15:15.430
I was so lonely.

00:15:15.430 --> 00:15:19.590
An Odd Jobs without you is like you without glasses.

00:15:19.590 --> 00:15:22.230
Doesn't that mean you only need my glasses?!

00:15:22.860 --> 00:15:24.590
Shinpachi...

00:15:27.420 --> 00:15:29.950
Is this really a wart?!

00:15:29.950 --> 00:15:32.050
This cute girl...

00:15:32.050 --> 00:15:33.900
Wait, does it even matter if she's a wart...

00:15:33.900 --> 00:15:37.730
Don't be fooled!

00:15:39.890 --> 00:15:43.290
Kaiser Okita de Sade Sogo III!

00:15:43.290 --> 00:15:45.080
Hi-Hijikata-san...

00:15:45.080 --> 00:15:50.190
I don't want to see you hit a woman...

00:15:50.450 --> 00:15:51.420
Hey!

00:15:51.420 --> 00:15:53.400
Hang on, Jerkaiser!

00:15:53.400 --> 00:15:55.080
Huh? How?

00:15:55.420 --> 00:15:58.260
A-After Kondo-san left,

00:15:58.260 --> 00:16:02.110
I devoted my life to making the force bigger...

00:16:03.420 --> 00:16:09.110
I didn't hesitate to commit atrocities for the sake of protecting the Shinsengumi...

00:16:09.520 --> 00:16:11.480
But Hijikata-san...

00:16:11.480 --> 00:16:13.560
If I let you get your hands dirty,

00:16:13.560 --> 00:16:18.190
the Shinsengumi will just be a gang of thugs.

00:16:18.190 --> 00:16:19.420
Hijikata-san?!

00:16:19.420 --> 00:16:20.710
Don't be fooled!

00:16:20.710 --> 00:16:22.460
That's a wart! Just a wart!

00:16:22.460 --> 00:16:25.050
I-I wanted...

00:16:25.050 --> 00:16:29.280
...to have another bowl of mayonnaise with you...

00:16:29.280 --> 00:16:30.430
That never happened!

00:16:30.430 --> 00:16:31.900
You said it was dog food!

00:16:31.910 --> 00:16:33.210
Stop lying!

00:16:33.210 --> 00:16:34.920
Sogo! Get a hold of yourself!

00:16:34.920 --> 00:16:37.240
Uh, that's not going to help!

00:16:37.240 --> 00:16:38.450
You're the one who needs to get a hold of yourself!

00:16:38.450 --> 00:16:40.210
Didn't we establish that he's just a wart?!

00:16:40.210 --> 00:16:41.350
Move!

00:16:41.350 --> 00:16:42.550
I'll finish it off!

00:16:42.550 --> 00:16:44.130
Stop, Shin-chan!

00:16:44.130 --> 00:16:46.800
A samurai would never attack a dying man!

00:16:46.800 --> 00:16:48.070
S-Sis!

00:16:48.070 --> 00:16:49.720
And she already gave birth!

00:16:49.720 --> 00:16:52.800
How could you be so cruel?

00:16:53.050 --> 00:16:55.680
What am I supposed to tell this child?

00:16:55.680 --> 00:16:57.190
Don't be fooled!

00:16:57.190 --> 00:16:58.520
She's not your sister!

00:16:58.520 --> 00:16:59.390
She's just a wart!

00:16:59.390 --> 00:17:01.430
You have no right to say that!

00:17:01.430 --> 00:17:02.830
Fine!

00:17:02.830 --> 00:17:06.490
I won't let you use my sister's face to play wife to the gorilla...

00:17:06.490 --> 00:17:07.500
...any longer!

00:17:07.500 --> 00:17:08.640
Stop!

00:17:08.640 --> 00:17:09.410
You've got it wrong!

00:17:09.410 --> 00:17:11.340
The father of my child is actually...

00:17:11.340 --> 00:17:13.170
Look at the hair!

00:17:15.510 --> 00:17:17.650
What are you doing?!

00:17:17.650 --> 00:17:19.000
Th-That hair...

00:17:19.000 --> 00:17:20.910
That V-shaped hair is...?

00:17:20.910 --> 00:17:21.950
Of course not!

00:17:21.950 --> 00:17:24.630
How could the two of you have a kid when you barely even know each other?!

00:17:24.630 --> 00:17:25.970
Forgive me, Toshi-san.

00:17:26.390 --> 00:17:28.690
I couldn't hide my true feelings.

00:17:28.690 --> 00:17:32.520
Even after pretending to be married to Isao-san...

00:17:32.520 --> 00:17:33.450
Wait a sec!

00:17:33.450 --> 00:17:36.270
My sister's turned into one hell of a slutty bitch?!

00:17:36.270 --> 00:17:37.310
Please!

00:17:37.310 --> 00:17:39.320
Take us away!

00:17:39.320 --> 00:17:41.300
To a world without gorillas!

00:17:41.300 --> 00:17:42.150
Hijikata-san!

00:17:42.150 --> 00:17:43.300
Don't be fooled!

00:17:43.300 --> 00:17:45.340
You don't have a kid!

00:17:45.780 --> 00:17:49.470
You thought you could fool me with such a cheap trick?

00:17:49.470 --> 00:17:51.530
Give me the kid and scram.

00:17:51.810 --> 00:17:52.800
I'll look after it.

00:17:52.800 --> 00:17:54.540
You've been completely fooled!

00:17:54.540 --> 00:17:56.970
Hey, can you spare the kid?

00:17:56.970 --> 00:17:59.680
Let me raise Togoro!

00:17:59.680 --> 00:18:00.480
Calm down!

00:18:00.480 --> 00:18:02.090
Who the hell is Togoro?!

00:18:02.090 --> 00:18:04.800
Oh? His name is Togoro?

00:18:04.800 --> 00:18:07.150
What an adorable child.

00:18:07.150 --> 00:18:09.510
Would you mind letting me hold him?

00:18:09.510 --> 00:18:12.810
Oh, he's a newborn, so you'll need to support his head.

00:18:12.810 --> 00:18:16.500
My, such an adorable child.

00:18:16.500 --> 00:18:19.190
His mother and father must be lovely.

00:18:19.830 --> 00:18:22.830
But he's not as adorable as my little girl.

00:18:22.830 --> 00:18:23.190
Isn't that right,

00:18:23.190 --> 00:18:24.310
Isako-chan?

00:18:24.310 --> 00:18:25.550
Kondo-san!

00:18:25.550 --> 00:18:26.520
You've lost your mind!

00:18:26.520 --> 00:18:28.480
You've completely lost your mind!

00:18:29.780 --> 00:18:32.160
I won't let you have your happiness!

00:18:32.160 --> 00:18:32.830
You're all!

00:18:32.830 --> 00:18:34.050
You're all...

00:18:34.050 --> 00:18:37.130
...headed straight down misery lane!

00:18:37.130 --> 00:18:39.240
T-Togoro!

00:18:39.240 --> 00:18:40.800
You can no longer be a straight man!

00:18:40.800 --> 00:18:42.290
You've been completely fooled!

00:18:42.920 --> 00:18:45.060
Don't come any closer!

00:18:45.060 --> 00:18:46.660
I'll jump off with the child!

00:18:46.660 --> 00:18:47.740
Calm down, Kondo-san!

00:18:47.740 --> 00:18:48.620
Let's not be hasty!

00:18:48.620 --> 00:18:49.970
You're the one who needs to calm down!

00:18:49.970 --> 00:18:51.600
We're supposed to be smacking down warts!

00:18:51.600 --> 00:18:53.790
Why are you stopping a wart from killing itself?!

00:18:53.790 --> 00:18:55.410
The child has done nothing wrong.

00:18:55.410 --> 00:18:56.610
You should blame...

00:18:56.610 --> 00:18:57.760
...Otae and me!

00:18:57.760 --> 00:18:59.750
Blame your poor excuse for a brain!

00:18:59.750 --> 00:19:01.390
Kill me instead!

00:19:01.390 --> 00:19:02.980
Please...

00:19:02.980 --> 00:19:03.950
Spare Togoro!

00:19:03.950 --> 00:19:06.690
Why are you giving up your life for a wart?!

00:19:06.690 --> 00:19:08.990
To protect your child with your life...

00:19:09.520 --> 00:19:12.490
Isn't thats how a true parent would behave?

00:19:13.040 --> 00:19:14.490
Yet look at you.

00:19:15.210 --> 00:19:18.500
You intend to die by yourself and leave us behind?

00:19:19.180 --> 00:19:20.870
Wh-Who are you?

00:19:20.870 --> 00:19:22.880
How cruel...

00:19:23.370 --> 00:19:29.750
You don't remember who comforted you at the bar after your wife ran out on you?

00:19:29.750 --> 00:19:32.140
A-Are you...

00:19:32.140 --> 00:19:33.160
From the bar...

00:19:33.160 --> 00:19:34.680
From the bar!

00:19:34.680 --> 00:19:35.880
Zurako-san!

00:19:35.880 --> 00:19:37.130
How?!

00:19:37.130 --> 00:19:39.300
How did you give birth?!

00:19:39.300 --> 00:19:41.690
You are a father now!

00:19:41.690 --> 00:19:45.120
So for her sake, for my sake...

00:19:45.120 --> 00:19:46.110
You must live!

00:19:46.110 --> 00:19:48.800
Aren't the two of you enemies?!

00:19:48.800 --> 00:19:50.200
Look, it's your father,

00:19:50.200 --> 00:19:50.990
Gorillina.

00:19:50.990 --> 00:19:52.330
He can't be the father!

00:19:52.330 --> 00:19:54.150
That's an actual gorilla there!

00:19:54.150 --> 00:19:56.890
Oh, her name is Gorillina?

00:19:56.890 --> 00:19:58.720
Such an adorable child.

00:19:58.720 --> 00:20:01.410
Would you mind letting me hold her?

00:20:01.410 --> 00:20:04.500
Oh, she's a newborn, so her banana hasn't been peeled yet.

00:20:04.500 --> 00:20:06.060
No shit!

00:20:06.350 --> 00:20:09.030
My, such an adorable child.

00:20:09.030 --> 00:20:12.110
But she's not as adorable as my little girl.

00:20:12.110 --> 00:20:12.950
Kyubei-san?!

00:20:12.950 --> 00:20:13.990
Isn't that right,

00:20:13.990 --> 00:20:14.460
Willina?

00:20:14.460 --> 00:20:16.220
The hell are you raising?!

00:20:16.220 --> 00:20:17.810
You've lost more than your mind!

00:20:19.220 --> 00:20:21.440
I don't need a wife or husband!

00:20:21.440 --> 00:20:26.020
I have become the ultimate creature who can be both mother and father!

00:20:26.360 --> 00:20:29.170
Have no fear!

00:20:29.170 --> 00:20:30.570
I will make these children happy!

00:20:30.570 --> 00:20:31.700
Togoro!

00:20:31.700 --> 00:20:32.730
Gorillina!

00:20:32.730 --> 00:20:33.780
Willina!

00:20:33.780 --> 00:20:34.700
Damn it!

00:20:34.700 --> 00:20:37.940
Cut this shit out!

00:20:52.470 --> 00:20:54.750
I knew something was wrong.

00:20:54.750 --> 00:20:57.740
Hijikata-san was also infected by a wart.

00:20:58.420 --> 00:21:00.580
Warts that are attracted to ambition...

00:21:00.840 --> 00:21:03.450
This was one hellish nightmare,

00:21:03.450 --> 00:21:05.980
but I learned a valuable lesson.

00:21:06.430 --> 00:21:08.610
The show is finally back on the air.

00:21:09.360 --> 00:21:11.690
I need to stay focused

00:21:11.690 --> 00:21:15.360
and aim as high as I can every week.

00:21:15.360 --> 00:21:16.600
Okay!

00:21:16.600 --> 00:21:18.010
It's all over!

00:21:18.010 --> 00:21:20.640
Starting next week, I'll need to get to work!

00:21:20.640 --> 00:21:22.020
Let's do this!

00:21:22.020 --> 00:21:24.000
No, it's not over yet.

00:21:24.000 --> 00:21:25.150
Huh?

00:21:29.210 --> 00:21:31.760
You're also a wart, Shinpachi.

00:21:31.760 --> 00:21:34.640
What?!

00:21:34.640 --> 00:21:36.530
Man, I was worried.

00:21:36.530 --> 00:21:40.160
Everyone looked different when the show came back on air.

00:21:40.160 --> 00:21:42.590
I had a hard time keeping up with everyone.

00:21:42.590 --> 00:21:44.560
Why was I the only one left out?

00:21:44.560 --> 00:21:46.100
Get a clue, you alien warts.

00:21:46.100 --> 00:21:50.720
But at this rate, it's going to get messy when we catch up to the manga and go on another break.

00:21:50.720 --> 00:21:52.990
These people are actually going to train themselves next time.

00:21:53.890 --> 00:21:55.230
Can't help it.

00:21:55.230 --> 00:21:56.390
When that happens...

00:21:58.490 --> 00:22:00.410
I'll go with this.

00:22:00.410 --> 00:22:02.380
[The End]

00:23:29.960 --> 00:23:38.170
[Next Episode]

00:23:30.720 --> 00:23:33.320
Isn't it a little late for New Year cards?

00:23:33.320 --> 00:23:36.950
And why did everyone send one?!

00:23:36.950 --> 00:23:38.170
What a pain in the ass!

00:23:38.170 --> 00:23:39.460
So next time:

00:23:38.630 --> 00:23:41.930
[Use a Calligraphy Pen for New Year Cards]

00:23:39.460 --> 00:23:41.220
Use a calligraphy pen for New Year cards!

00:23:41.220 --> 00:23:43.430
Plus another one that's a little late.

00:23:42.390 --> 00:23:44.890
[The Heart Comes Before Chocolate]
